    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Caricature 5: Cadence Runner\n\nBefore activating: run supabase/migration.sql and fill the campaign_config row.\n\nRuns hourly. Needs instantly_campaign_delivered and instantly_campaign_not_delivered in campaign_config; the email copy for both campaigns is in docs/setup.md.\n\nCredentials: Supabase API, HubSpot App Token, Header Auth `Authorization: Bearer <Instantly key>`, Slack API.\n\nFull guide: caricature-campaign/docs/setup.md in github.com/sashank-and-sales-gtme/gtm-engineering-portfolio",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 400,
